{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40080","label":"MEMORIES TELLER · Part 2"},"label":"It Has to Be This Way: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_ce006_2_02_e","next":"event_ce006_2_03_e","speakers":{"elegg":"Elegg","ce006_03":"Lily","ce006_npc_01":"Adam","ce006_01":"EVE","roam":"Roam","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon","rapi":"Rapi","privaty":"Privaty"},"icons":{"elegg":"si_c500_00_s","ce006_03":"si_c852_00_s","ce006_npc_01":"si_c853_00_s","ce006_01":"si_c850_00_s","roam":"si_c931_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","privaty":"si_c170_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_1","text":"The data in these terminals really is all pertaining to art. It's incredible how much is here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"bunkerofartist","bgArt":"bunkerofartist","image":null,"bgm":"collab_bgm_sb_field_floodedcs_inst","movie":null,"shown":["elegg","ce006_03"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_2","text":"I'm no art expert, but I'm pretty sure this is going to make waves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_3","text":"I can see the headline now, \"Humanity's Artistry Once Lost, Found Once Again.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_4","text":"Even if it's only in digitized form, it's remarkable how much has been preserved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_5","text":"You think it'd be okay if I installed BOOM here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_6","text":"Uh... I'm not sure what that is, but I have a feeling that you shouldn't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_7","text":"I guess you're right. Too bad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_8","text":"What's the condition of these terminals?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_9","text":"Really good. I can't believe how well they've been maintained.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_10","text":"The bunker's power supply is mostly being used to keep these terminals up and running, so they're honestly in great shape.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_11","text":"There is one thing that's bothering me though.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_12","text":"There seem to be recordings of the bunker's interior as well,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_13","text":"but they stopped about 40 years ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_14","text":"The data's not corrupted, is it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_15","text":"No, it's fine. Data itself doesn't decay organically.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_16","text":"It must be that the hardware itself has aged and begun to deteriorate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_17","text":"I think so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_18","text":"Do you think it can be fixed?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_19","text":"If you help me, absolutely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_20","text":"All right then, let's give it a shot. I'll do what I can to help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_21","text":"Hehe. Sounds good.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_22","text":"This plot certainly seems to be thickening.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ce006_npc_01","ce006_01","roam"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_23","text":"Indeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_24","text":"EVE, it's not that I disagree with what you're doing, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_25","text":"We do have our own things to do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_26","text":"I know, but I can't pretend as if I didn't see this and move on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_27","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_28","text":"What if it ends up taking some time to resolve?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_29","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_30","text":"We'll reconsider our approach if and when that time comes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_31","text":"... All right, fine. In the meantime, let's do what we can to help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_32","text":"EVE, this is not your fight.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_33","text":"Do you have nothing better to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_34","text":"Quite the opposite.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_35","text":"Then are you looking for excitement?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_36","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_37","text":"Are you expecting a reward?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_38","text":"Haha, not that, either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_39","text":"So you don't have much free time, aren't looking for excitement, and don't expect a reward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_40","text":"Why are you helping then?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_41","text":"Beats me. This isn't the first time this has happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_42","text":"I can't explain it, but I just feel like I should.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_43","text":"------","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_44","text":"You are sentimental.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_45","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_46","text":"Ha! I like the cut of this robot's jib!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_47","text":"Adam, you have not wiped off the black mold on your face. Would you like me to clean it off?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_48","text":"... I take it back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_49","text":"Can I speak my mind?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rapi","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_50","text":"Go on. Let's hear it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_51","text":"I'm curious to hear why you think this is more suspicious than usual.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_52","text":"... Much appreciated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_53","text":"Don't mention it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_54","text":"First of all, I understand what this place is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_55","text":"While it is hard to believe, I can get past the fact a human has managed to survive on the surface for over 100 years.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_56","text":"I also get how this place is packed to the gills with digital data on art.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_57","text":"But setting all that aside, I simply don't trust this Hermin guy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_58","text":"What if he's some deranged criminal or something?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_59","text":"That door was welded shut from the outside, and the entire lake was electrified.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_60","text":"He looks pretty frail to me. I don't think he poses a threat to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_61","text":"I'm not talking about now. I mean before, when he was young.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_62","text":"If you're saying he intentionally welded the door shut and then electrified the water... it's not exactly the most efficient plan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_63","text":"Hmm, true. He's not a supervillain from a comic book, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_64","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_64","text":"Let's wait and see what Elegg and Lily find in the recovered footage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_65","text":"Maybe Privaty will be able to offer some answers as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_66","text":"I hope so. After all, we're talking about a human survivor up on the surface, after all these years.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_67","text":"This is bound to become a major news story back in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_68","text":"Oooh, we should tell Hermin our names so he can tell all the TV presenters about us!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_69","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_70","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_2_03_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_2_03_s_71","text":"What? Why do you two look so grim?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgA